WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
If this is your prep, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:10.640
Just follow along step by step. Your prep contains three packets, one Mango

3
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.760
flavored packet,

4
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.400
and two Fruit Punch packets. You'll also need the mixing container that comes

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.280
with it and water.

6
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:22.640
Start with your first dose. This is the Mango packet and you'll take it the

7
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.360
evening before

8
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:29.590
your procedure. Open the Mango packet and pour it into the container. Add 16

9
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.040
ounces of water up

10
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:36.320
to the fill line. Shake or stir it until it's completely dissolved. Now take

11
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.880
your time. Slowly

12
00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:43.820
drink all of it within 30 minutes. There's no rush. Just keep sipping steadily.

13
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.200
Once you've

14
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.460
finished, refill the same container or a 16 ounce cup with water. Drink this

15
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.840
glass of water within

16
00:00:51.840 --> 00:01:00.980
30 minutes too. Your second dose happens 12 hours after the first. This time

17
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.320
you'll use both Fruit

18
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:08.240
Punch packets. Open both Fruit Punch packets and pour them into the container.

19
00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.120
Add water to the

20
00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:15.200
16 ounce fill line and shake or stir until dissolved. Just like before, slowly

21
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.480
drink all of it within

22
00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:21.660
30 minutes. Then refill the container with 16 ounces of water and finish that

23
00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.800
