24
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:28.860
The timing of this second dose is really important. Make sure you take it at

25
00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.200
the right

26
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:33.850
time so your prep is as effective as possible. You must drink all of the prep

27
00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:34.800
solution as directed

28
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:39.300
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

29
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.000
but finishing the

30
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.320
entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your procedure. If the

31
00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:45.440
prep isn't completed

32
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:52.160
as directed, we may need to reschedule and neither of us wants that. After you've finished each dose,

33
00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:56.300
keep drinking clear liquids throughout the evening. Staying hydrated will help

34
00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.120
you feel better and

35
00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:02.420
