36
00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:03.760
to the bathroom,

37
00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:10.400
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That's it. You've got this.

38
00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:15.850
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any

39
00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:16.560
